      "item": "NYRx pharmacy copayments ($1 generic, $3 brand, $50 per quarter maximum)",
      "why": "Charged by NYRx, not the plan; exempt: under 21, pregnant and postpartum members, nursing home and certain residential and waiver enrollees, psychotropic, TB and family planning drugs.",
